SUMMARY:Taurus Season: Astrology/Meditation/Movement/Journaling with Sense
 ful Wellness
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**Taurus Season**: Astrology/Meditation/M
 ovement/Journaling\n6pm-7:30pm\n\nWhen the sun moves into a new sign an en
 ergetic shift occurs. Learning to connect\, listen\, and set intentions wi
 th the sun is a beautiful way to add ritual into your life.\n\nTaurus seas
 on is from 4/20-5/20 and for this gathering we'll discuss the Astrological
  happenings of the zodiac season and where it will impact you personally (
 birth chart recommended).\n\nAs with all energetic shifts\, getting into y
 our body is important. Together we'll ground into the energy through medit
 ation and movement themed around the season. Accommodations/Modification c
 an be made for ALL bodies\, come as you are.\n\nWe'll close out with time 
 for journaling and optional sharing.\n\nPrice: $11
